abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, attack models and result files for the article
  "Boundary Conditions: When AI Agents Need Decentralized Identity". The
  package contains the SS-AID prototype (DID and verifiable credential
  issuance, a policy enforcement point, dynamic capability tokens and a
  revocation registry), an OAuth 2.1 baseline, the attack and scaling
  models, a Tamarin specification of the delegation rules, and every result
  file behind a number in the article. The README labels each number as a
  measurement, a model output or a derived value.
